OL,3,CCCTV appears to show man charged with
OL,4,Cmurder of Scottish woman in Athens
OL,6,FNew CCTV footage appears to show a man
OL,7,Fwheeling a suitcase down a street in
OL,8,FAthens, Greece, near where the body of
OL,9,Fa Scottish woman was later found.
OL,11,FThe footage, released by Greek media
OL,12,Fand confirmed to ITV News by police,
OL,13,Fshows a man with a large suitcase and
OL,14,Fa backpack.
OL,16,FIt was taken near where the body of
OL,17,FElisabeth-Jane Ross, 38, was
OL,18,Fdiscovered inside a suitcase on July
OL,19,F18.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
