OL,3,CCCTV appears to show man charged with
OL,4,Cmurder of Scottish woman in Athens
OL,6,FSharif Ahmadzai, a 26-year-old Afghan
OL,7,Frefugee who has been living lawfully
OL,8,Fin Greece for a decade, was charged
OL,9,Fwith murder in connection with the
OL,10,Fcase earlier this week.
OL,12,FHe has denied murder and will appear
OL,13,Fin court on Wednesday morning.
OL,15,FMs Ross, who is thought to be from
OL,16,FEdinburgh, is believed to have died
OL,17,Fbetween five and seven days before she
OL,18,Fwas found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
