OL,3,CCCTV appears to show man charged with
OL,4,Cmurder of Scottish woman in Athens
OL,6,FHowever, someone was reportedly using
OL,7,Fher mobile phone to send messages
OL,8,Fpurporting to be her up until the day
OL,9,Fher body was found.
OL,11,FMs Ross entered Greece on June 26 and
OL,12,Fwas working with the NGO Love Every
OL,13,FNation in Athens, which was founded by
OL,14,FAhmadzai and his American wife, Alaina
OL,15,FHall.
OL,17,FAccording to the NGO's website, which
OL,18,Fhas since been taken offline, the
OL,19,Fcouple met volunteering at a migrant
OL,20,Fcamp in Lesvos in 2016, where Ahmadzai
OL,21,Fwas working as a translator.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
