OL,3,CCCTV appears to show man charged with
OL,4,Cmurder of Scottish woman in Athens
OL,6,FAhmadzai converted to Christianity in
OL,7,F2017. Their NGO is described as a
OL,8,Freligious organisation which provides
OL,9,Fnecessities to families and
OL,10,Findividuals in Athens, including food,
OL,11,Fmedicine and temporary housing.
OL,13,FThe Hellenic Police, Greece's national
OL,14,Fforce, identified Ms Ross using
OL,15,Ffingerprints.
OL,17,FA replica pistol and a knife were
OL,18,Ffound at the suspect's home.
OL,20,FWho is Ahmadzai?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
