OL,3,CCCTV appears to show man charged with
OL,4,Cmurder of Scottish woman in Athens
OL,6,FAhmadzai was born in Afghanistan and
OL,7,Farrived in Greece in 2016, according
OL,8,Fto the Love Every Nation website.
OL,10,FHis father was killed by the Taliban
OL,11,Fwhen he was four years old.
OL,13,FHis brother was kidnapped by the
OL,14,FTaliban five years later, and when he
OL,15,Fwas 15, his mother and two other
OL,16,Fsiblings were killed by a bomb.
OL,18,FOn the Love Every Nation website,
OL,19,FAhmadzai says he was "left totally
OL,20,Falone", and decided to leave
OL,21,FAfghanistan.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
