OL,3,CCCTV appears to show man charged with
OL,4,Cmurder of Scottish woman in Athens
OL,6,FHe then travelled to the Greek island
OL,7,FLesvos, before moving to Athens. He is
OL,8,Fa lightweight boxer and won the super
OL,9,Flightweight boxing title in March
OL,10,Fearlier this year.
OL,12,FTributes to Ms Ross
OL,14,FA church pastor has paid tribute to Ms
OL,15,FRoss, also known as Lisa, describing
OL,16,Fher as a "precious" member of the
OL,17,Fcongregation at City on a Hill, an
OL,18,Findependent Christian church based in
OL,19,FEdinburgh and the Lothians, for 20
OL,20,Fyears.
