OL,3,CCCTV appears to show man charged with
OL,4,Cmurder of Scottish woman in Athens
OL,6,FIn a video posted on the church's
OL,7,FFacebook page, Peter Anderson said:
OL,8,F"It's been a really tough week for our
OL,9,Fchurch.
OL,11,FHe said Ms Ross had a "big passion"
OL,12,Ffor missionary work.
OL,14,F"Lisa's life was actually all about
OL,15,Fmission," Mr Anderson said.
OL,17,F"She served people and she cared for
OL,18,Fpeople all over the world."
